      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Not at today''s prices: before she buys it, the new boat isn''t sunk, so it must pay its way like everything else.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7040
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||So what is fixed in the short run? Whatever is already sunk. The skill is to stop counting it, and to see when the long run turns it back into a choice.':
